  "notes": "USAGE:\n- 〜を{拒否|きょひ}する (to refuse/reject ~)\n- {拒否|きょひ}{反応|はんのう} (rejection reaction - medical)\n- {拒否権|きょひけん} (veto power, right of refusal)\n{拒否|きょひ} is stronger and more formal than {断|ことわ}る (to decline). It implies a firm, sometimes defiant refusal.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {要求|ようきゅう}を{拒否|きょひ}する (to refuse a demand)\n- {署名|しょめい}を{拒否|きょひ}する (to refuse to sign)\n- {出席|しゅっせき}を{拒否|きょひ}する (to refuse to attend)\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- {断|ことわ}る (to decline - softer)\n- {却下|きゃっか} (rejection - of proposals/appeals)\n- {受|う}け{入|い}れる (to accept - antonym)",
